{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46369","headline":"东林作寄金陵知己 · 齐己","name":"东林作寄金陵知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十八贤真在，时来拂榻看。\n已知前事远，更结後人难。\n泉滴胜清磬，松香掩白檀。\n凭君听朝贵，谁欲厌簪冠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46369.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46369","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}